{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1558191-was-it-really-the-archangel-michael-samiel-met","id":1558191,"title":"Was it really the Archangel Michael Samiel met?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-02-08T13:35:43-08:00","id":1558191,"title":"Was it really the Archangel Michael Samiel met?","content":"Do you think Samiel of the Salubri really met the Archangel while Saulot was away? Or do you think it might have been a demon pretending to be Michael, or the mad Toreader who thought he was the archangel or some madness or something else?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28147-snailslayer","name":"Snailslayer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-08T22:08:49-08:00","id":1558199,"title":"","content":"The earliest surviving real-world mentions of Michael's name are in Jewish texts dating back to the Second or Third Century B.C. Accounts of Samiel's death have him perishing during either the First or Second Baali War, both of which were centuries before that.<br /> <br /> So in games where the angels are just the stuff of legend, then definitely not. Samiel came and went before mortals made Michael up.<br /> <br /> In games where either the Fallen or the angels named in the Book of Nod really exist, then sure, possibly. Michael could have inserted holy warriors into the ranks of the Kindred to influence that diabolists could gain if granted immortality. Why not?<br /> <br /> The Toreador Michael dates back to Sumeria in the Second Millennium, B.C. and could have been the one who inspired Samiel as well. It would have been a footnote at best in Michael's story by the time of Dark Ages Constantinople, but making the war against the Baali a part of the prologue of his backstory lends an aesthetically pleasing irony to the fate that he meets at the fangs of Mary The Black. It brings him full circle in a way. So again, why not? Use that if it makes for a good story to tell at your gaming table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-09T01:49:30-08:00","id":1558201,"title":"","content":"Probably was the real deal<br /> While according the Book of Nod he cursed Caine and his descendants (mortal and immortal alike) to be forever burned by fire in Demon the Fallen he handed out other Curses, including but not limited to the curse to mankind with mortality.<br /> <br /> But the best evidance he probably was the real one, is the Blooding Ritual Samiel designed after his encounter with the Archangel<br /> <br /> Part of the blooding is to take up a Angelic name - Celestial name if you go with the Fallen angle not the True Name - but more importantly the ability to chanel to power of the said Elohim<br /> The proper Blooding gvies you the ability called <i>Blessing of the Name</i><br /> The warrior channels the power of the Elohim he shares the Name<br /> ...and since they are not smitten the moment they first used this, it is safe to say the <i>Blessing of the Name</i>\u200b uses the power with <i>premission </i>- and also the power's description details why and how it works and the wanton usage could make the said Elohim angry<br /> \u200b<br /> While according Demon: The Fallen Mich threw away his sword after he had a talk with Lucifer before the night of banishment and left it on Earth, he was not above it seems to forge an usefull weapon against Demons in the form of the Warrior Salubri<br /> <br /> Mi-ka-il\u200b is from Ebla, embraced in 2149 BC... Samiel already was ancient with his brood and been thrugh a few Baali Wars and fight against Demons armed with the power of the Names - also a Toreador not really been able to grant such powers even with his reality warping <i>Chimerstry</i>\u200b (officially he had lvl 6)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-09T08:06:06-08:00","id":1558203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1558191-was-it-really-the-archangel-michael-samiel-met?p=1558201#post1558201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably was the real deal<br /> While according the Book of Nod he cursed Caine and his descendants (mortal and immortal alike) to be forever burned by fire in Demon the Fallen he handed out other Curses, including but not limited to the curse to mankind with mortality.<br /> <br /> But the best evidance he probably was the real one, is the Blooding Ritual Samiel designed after his encounter with the Archangel<br /> <br /> Part of the blooding is to take up a Angelic name - Celestial name if you go with the Fallen angle not the True Name - but more importantly the ability to chanel to power of the said Elohim<br /> The proper Blooding gvies you the ability called <i>Blessing of the Name</i><br /> The warrior channels the power of the Elohim he shares the Name<br /> ...and since they are not smitten the moment they first used this, it is safe to say the <i>Blessing of the Name</i> uses the power with <i>premission </i>- and also the power's description details why and how it works and the wanton usage could make the said Elohim angry<br /> \u200b<br /> While according Demon: The Fallen Mich threw away his sword after he had a talk with Lucifer before the night of banishment and left it on Earth, he was not above it seems to forge an usefull weapon against Demons in the form of the Warrior Salubri<br /> <br /> Mi-ka-il\u200b is from Ebla, embraced in 2149 BC... Samiel already was ancient with his brood and been thrugh a few Baali Wars and fight against Demons armed with the power of the Names - also a Toreador not really been able to grant such powers even with his reality warping <i>Chimerstry</i>\u200b (officially he had lvl 6)</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, I can't help but wonder if Saulot was burning with jealousy that his warrior childe got a direct meeting with an angel and was given divine lore, while Saulot got shit and didn't get anything, and it explicitly happened while Saulot was away. Like, you've got the gentle healer who wants redemption and he gets zero contact, but Samiel gets contact not just from an angel but from the commander of heaven's armies. <br /> <br /> Now I am also wondering what Mi-ka-il's relationship was with the Salubri and Samiel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28147-snailslayer","name":"Snailslayer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-24T09:09:41-08:00","id":1558490,"title":"","content":"I think the being Samiel met was actually the Toreador Methuselah Michael (known as Mi-ka-il back then).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":26996,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","user":"Amethyst","date":". 02-24-2026, 09:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-24T09:29:20-08:00","id":1558492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1558191-was-it-really-the-archangel-michael-samiel-met?p=1558490#post1558490\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the being Samuel met was actually the Toreador Methuselah Michael (known as Mi-ka-il back then).</div> </div> </div> </div>Hardly<br /> Samiel was Embraced in the Second City or more likely, the First since he and his Warriors trained in the harsh land of Nod and there he met the Archangel<br /> Mi-ka-il is from Ebla, embraced in 2149 BC<br /> Samiel at least trice if not four time the age of Mi-ka-il...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-02T14:03:03-07:00","id":1559703,"title":"","content":"Could be.<br /> <br /> Could be that Michael is the inspiration for Michael the Angel.<br /> <br /> Could be it was a Demon, Angel, or spirit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-p